cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DenoGrad in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "DenoGrad: A Gradient-Based Framework for Data Refinement in Tabular and Time-Series Learning"
abstract: >-
  DenoGrad refines noisy data by optimizing them through a frozen, trained
  differentiable model. Each sample moves toward the relationship the model has
  learned, in proportion to its own error, without clean reference data. It
  supports tabular regression and time-series forecasting.
